<h2>Performance benefits of Sanitizers</h2>

<p>Valgrind uses dynamic instrumentation instead of static instrumentation =
at compile time, which leads to the high performance overhead that can be i=
mpractical for CPU-intensive applications. Sanitizers uses static instrumen=
tation and allows for similar checks with a lower overhead.</p>

