<h2>MSAN: Uninitialized memory reads</h2>

<p>AddressSanitizer does not detect reads of uninitialized memory. <a href=
=3D"https://clang.llvm.org/docs/MemorySanitizer.html">MemorySanitizer</a> w=
as developed for that. It needs a separate compilation and run. (See the <a=
 href=3D"https://clang.llvm.org/docs/MemorySanitizer.html">MemorySanitizer =
documentation</a>.) Why AddressSanitizer was not designed to include the fu=
nctionality of MemorySanitizer is unclear to me, and <a href=3D"https://sta=
ckoverflow.com/a/38523606/2995591">I'm not the only one</a>.</p>

<p>A run of MemorySanitizer follows:</p>

