<h2>TSAN: Data races</h2>

<p>ThreadSanitizer reports data races where multiple threads access data wi=
thout thread-race protection. (See the <a href=3D"https://clang.llvm.org/do=
cs/ThreadSanitizer.html">ThreadSanitizer documentation</a>.) An example fol=
lows:</p>

<pre><code>$ cat &gt;tiny.cpp &lt;&lt;'EOF'
#include &lt;thread&gt;

static volatile bool flip1{false};
static volatile bool flip2{false};

int main() {
  std::thread t([&amp;]() {
    while (!flip1);
    flip2 =3D true;
  });
  flip1 =3D true;
  while (!flip2);
  t.join();
}
EOF
$ clang++ -o tiny tiny.cpp -Wall -g -pthread <strong>-fsanitize=3Dthread</s=
trong>
