<h2>Conclusion</h2>

<p>If you are accustomed to Valgrind, give AddressSanitizer a try=E2=80=94j=
ust add the <code>-fsanitize=3Daddress</code> compilation plus linking para=
meter (that is, to all of the <code>CFLAGS</code>, <code>CXXFLAGS</code>, a=
nd <code>LDFLAGS</code>) as the first try. If you find it great, check the =
"<a href=3D"https://developers.redhat.com/blog/2021/05/05/memory-error-chec=
king-in-c-and-c-comparing-sanitizers-and-valgrind#tldr">A quick Sanitizers =
how-to</a>" section for fine-tuning the experience.</p>
